generated9 licensing
===================

This is a derivative of 9front and Plan 9. Existing code keeps its original
licenses and copyright notices. The upstream licensing notice, including its
font, Ghostscript, and other exceptions, is in lib/legal/NOTICE. The upstream
MIT license is in lib/legal/mit. Other component-specific notices remain in
their original locations.

The u9fs import is covered by its original permissive Lucent notice in
sys/src/cmd/unix/u9fs/LICENSE, not by a replacement license from this project.
The MIT notice accompanying Russ Cox's boot/qemu source is reproduced in
boot/LICENSE.rsc and applies to the portions derived from that source.

